Subject: [PATCH 12/17] bridge: mirror live FlexDMD display into m_dmdFrame

FlexDMD-driven tables (no PinMAME ROM, e.g. JP's Space Cadet) render score
and mission state through the script's FlexDMD stage, so GetDmdFrame stayed
empty even with the script running. Pull the live FlexDMD luminance frame
(0..255 bytes per dot, converted to the linear float lane the PinMAME
mirror serves) lazily on read, publishing only on change so m_dmdFrameId
stays a real change counter. Runs only when no frame is mirrored yet, so
VPM tables keep their existing frames. The first publish requires
non-blank content: an idle instance only ever serves its blank surface,
which must not reveal the overlay. Adds one narrow plugin accessor; no new
ABI surface, no script or table changes.

Target: vpinball/vpinball@64a480a96d1b972711fbb8eea014654c779b1e23

diff --git a/plugins/flexdmd/FlexDMDPlugin.cpp b/plugins/flexdmd/FlexDMDPlugin.cpp
--- a/plugins/flexdmd/FlexDMDPlugin.cpp
+++ b/plugins/flexdmd/FlexDMDPlugin.cpp
@@ -457,4 +457,34 @@ MSGPI_EXPORT void MSGPIAPI FlexDMDPluginUnload()
    scriptApi = nullptr;
    msgApi = nullptr;
    vpxApi = nullptr;
 }
+
+// Headless WASM bridge: snapshot the live FlexDMD dot-matrix display for
+// the WASM ABI. Pixels are bytes per dot in 0..255 sRGB luminance (same
+// layout FlexDMD::GetDmdPixels serves). False when no FlexDMD instance is
+// running: an idle instance only ever serves its blank surface.
+bool FlexDMD_GetDmdPixels(std::vector<uint8_t>& pixels, int& width, int& height)
+{
+   pixels.clear();
+   width = 0;
+   height = 0;
+   for (FlexDMD* pFlex : flexDmds)
+   {
+      if (pFlex == nullptr || !pFlex->GetRun())
+         continue;
+      width = pFlex->GetWidth();
+      height = pFlex->GetHeight();
+      if (width <= 0 || height <= 0)
+         continue;
+      pixels = pFlex->GetDmdPixels();
+      if ((int)pixels.size() < width * height)
+      {
+         pixels.clear();
+         width = 0;
+         height = 0;
+         continue;
+      }
+      return true;
+   }
+   return false;
+}
